summary:
  A Play after a stopped search result puts the first station of the list on.

history:
  Seen on the bench on 2026-09-23: Radio Swiss Jazz auditioned and stopped,
  then the Playing tab's Play started MANGORADIO, and Space did the same. An
  audition leaves lastPlay at -1 and every bare Play fell back to row 0.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TransportLogic.js

find:
      if (hasAudition === true) return { "what": "audition", "index": -1 };

replace:
      if (false) return { "what": "audition", "index": -1 };

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_transportlogic.qml::test_a_stopped_audition_is_what_play_brings_back.
  Line-neutral.
